# Force LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. Several checks compare generated content byte for byte — `inline-client-locale.mjs
# --check` regenerates the locale block and compares it with what is on disk, and `pack-encoding-check.mjs`
# compares the packed locale files with the source. With Windows' usual `core.autocrlf=true`, a checkout
# rewrites LF to CRLF in the working copy, so those comparisons fail for a reason that has nothing to do with
# the code, and only on some machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary or generated content that must not be touched at all.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.tgz binary
